---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Club History"
  description="The history of Bellshill Curling Club, founded 1872."
>
  <article class="prose max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1>Our History</h1>
    <p>
      Bellshill Curling Club was founded in 1872 by a group of local
      enthusiasts keen to bring the roaring game to the Lanarkshire community.
      For over 150 years the club has been a fixture of Scottish curling.
    </p>

    <h2>The early years</h2>
    <p>
      In the late 19th century, members played on outdoor ponds whenever the
      weather permitted — a far cry from today's indoor ice. Match reports
      from the era describe enthusiastic crowds and fiercely contested
      bonspiels against neighbouring villages.
    </p>

    <h2>Moving indoors</h2>
    <p>
      With the arrival of indoor ice in central Scotland, the club moved its
      home matches to a dedicated rink, allowing a full season of play
      regardless of the weather. This change opened the sport up to many more
      members and helped the club grow.
    </p>

    <h2>Modern day</h2>
    <p>
      Today we field teams in regional leagues and host friendly matches
      throughout the season. Our membership spans all ages and abilities, and
      we run regular taster sessions for newcomers.
    </p>

    <h2>Get involved</h2>
    <p>
      Whether you're a seasoned curler or have never set foot on the ice,
      we'd love to hear from you. Visit our
      <a href="/contact">contact page</a> to get in touch.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
